WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:03.164
Open Follow-up.

00:00:03.414 --> 00:00:07.067
Add the name, reason and next contact date, then

00:00:07.067 --> 00:00:07.878
confirm permission.

00:00:08.128 --> 00:00:11.061
The Pastor may assign a worker or leave the

00:00:11.061 --> 00:00:11.713
request unassigned.

00:00:11.963 --> 00:00:13.775
Save it and find it in the board.

00:00:14.025 --> 00:00:17.161
Open Record a contact or handoff, choose the outcome

00:00:17.161 --> 00:00:19.252
and add a brief factual note.

00:00:19.502 --> 00:00:21.964
Set the next date for an open request.

00:00:22.214 --> 00:00:25.533
For a handoff, select the next registered worker.

00:00:25.783 --> 00:00:27.270
Save and check the history.

00:00:27.520 --> 00:00:31.340
Completed requests and requests for no further contact stay

00:00:31.340 --> 00:00:31.765
closed.
